# ── Frontend (Vite) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Las variables VITE_* van en apps/web/.env (ver apps/web/.env.example).
# Este .env de la raíz NO lo lee Vite.

# ── Backend (server/.env) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Copia server/.env.example → server/.env
# MELODIX_ENV=development
# MELODIX_CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173
# SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
# SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=
# PORT=8000

# Android / Capacitor: apps/web/.env.android.example y docs/PLAY.md
